# Plans archive

- Canonical plan archive: repo root [`plans/`](plans/) (not only `.cursor/plans/`).
- After CreatePlan, completing a plan, or shipping plan work: write/copy the plan to `plans/YYYY-MM-DD-short-slug.md` and update `plans/INDEX.md` in the same session.
- Follow naming and status rules in `plans/README.md`.
- Point humans/agents at `plans/` from `completeContext.md` when mentioning plan history.
